                    "created_at": "1733251118",
                    "text": "What do you think, is this a fair price? \nWG room + studio apartment TOUR\n\n📍Neighborhood: Kreuzberg \n •  Rent Price for the room: €600\n •  First floor: 2 rooms, kitchen, bathroom \n •  Second floor: studio apartment with kitchen, bathroom and balcony \n\nIf you reading this, I’m pretty sure that you are looking for an answer to the question - how to find an apartment in Berlin? How to rent the flat? Yes, it’s hard, especially in Berlin, I can’t help you with that directly. But here you can find some information and understand something about prices and conditions. That’s how Berlins market looks like today 😄\nSubscribe, if you want to support me, this is really very important because I’m just getting started 🪩 \n\n#strassenumfrage #apartmentRental #Berlin #PrenzlauerBerg  #LivingInBerlin #ImmoScout #BerlinRent #LookingForApartment #BerlinHousing \n#LifelnGermany #RealEstate\n#BerlinApartments #FamilyHousing\n#RentalTips  #FindAnApartment",
